  "abstract": "This experiment tests the hypothesis that replacing the simple MLP forecaster in the SOTA architecture with a more powerful sequence model can improve performance. A Transformer Encoder with self-attention is used to model the temporal dynamics of the latent factors. The rest of the architecture (Factorizer, ResidualCopyHead, LayerNorm, Curvature Loss) is inherited from the validated SOTA model (ID 167/178).",
